== calibration-05b-result-card.dc.html




 5b · One result card, any test 







body{margin:0}


 5b · One result card, any test The card on board 5 is one instance of a single shape: a Chat/Tool Activity card with three status rows and the two action buttons the component already has. Its slots are the value and unit the test produces, the preset scope the setting belongs to (filament, process or printer), the base preset and printer that name the copy, the setting with its old and new values from the settings preview, and the word for what the person picks. A second calibration on the same base updates the same copy rather than adding a name. Tests whose result lives on the machine (Bambu’s measured pressure advance, input shaping) do not produce this card. The shape · every slot comes from the test’s declaration or the settings preview Save {value} as a new {scope} preset New preset · {base} · {printer} calibrated {setting} {old} → {new} {base} itself is unchanged Save preset Pick another {step} Temperature tower · filament preset Save 225 °C as a new filament preset New preset · Gray PETG · MK4 calibrated Nozzle temperature 240 → 225 °C Gray PETG itself is unchanged Save preset Pick another block Flow ratio · filament preset Save 0.95 as a new filament preset New preset · Gray PETG · MK4 calibrated Flow ratio 0.98 → 0.95 Gray PETG itself is unchanged Save preset Pick another tile VFA speed · process preset Save 120 mm/s as a new process preset New preset · 0.20mm Standard · MK4 calibrated Outer wall speed 200 → 120 mm/s 0.20mm Standard itself is unchanged Save preset Pick another band 


